## Codex Specifics

- Sandbox blocks `gpg-agent`/`ssh-agent` sockets, breaking signed `git commit` and SSH-authenticated `git push`. Use Codex shell escalation (`require_escalated`) for those commands when signing or SSH auth is required; don't allowlist `~/.gnupg/` or `~/.ssh/`.
